---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terence">
  <h1>Terence</h1>
  <p class="lede">Staff software engineer at <a href="https://www.offchainlabs.com/">Offchain Labs</a>.</p>

  <p>
    I've worked on Ethereum's consensus layer since 2018, mostly contributing to
    <a href="https://github.com/OffchainLabs/prysm">Prysm</a>. I'm also the author of
    <a href="https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-7732">EIP-7732</a> and
    <a href="https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-7805">EIP-7805</a>, two
    back-to-back headliners shipping in
    <a href="https://forkcast.org/upgrade/glamsterdam">Glamsterdam</a> and
    <a href="https://forkcast.org/upgrade/hegota">Hegotá</a>, Ethereum's upcoming
    upgrades. Most of my
    work lives on <a href="https://github.com/terencechain">GitHub</a>, and I share
    notes on <a href="https://ethresear.ch/u/terence">ethresear.ch</a>.
  </p>

</Layout>
